(7650939, 1244629, 30861, '<td valign="top">I may have to eat my hat, but I''m guessing this is Larry''s hat?</td>', 'I may have to eat my hat, but I''m guessing this is Larry''s hat?', '2020-01-20 18:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7650949, 1244938, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of stapling 2 paper plates together and drawing windows and hatches on it to make a "Jupiter 2" from Lost in Space. (As a kid, of course). I should have thought of that and entered this challenge with it. Or maybe that oversight was appropriate for the hindsight challenge, which I also missed.</td>', 'Reminds me of stapling 2 paper plates together and drawing windows and hatches on it to make a "Jupiter 2" from Lost in Space. (As a kid, of course). I should have thought of that and entered this challenge with it. Or maybe that oversight was appropriate for the hindsight challenge, which I also missed.', '2020-01-20 23:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
